我们不忍心从你手里抢走餐厅
We feel bad about taking it from you,

889
00:39:35,020 --> 00:39:36,560
而且餐厅的老板得付
and also the owner of the diner owes

890
00:39:37,540 --> 00:39:39,380
老屁股下巴哥跟市政府两万五罚款
old butt-chin here and the city $25,000.

891
00:39:40,260 --> 00:39:40,740
什么
What?

892
00:39:41,280 --> 00:39:42,440
餐厅又是我的啦
The diner is mine again?

893
00:39:42,520 --> 00:39:43,440
对啊 抱歉
Yeah, sorry.

894
00:39:45,740 --> 00:39:46,380
太好啦
Yes!

895
00:39:46,960 --> 00:39:48,560
太好啦 太好啦
Yes! Yes!

896
00:39:48,560 --> 00:39:50,100
我的宝宝又回到我手里啦
I have my baby back.

897
00:39:50,480 --> 00:39:51,720
你全身哪里不是宝宝大小
You have baby everything.

898
00:39:52,880 --> 00:39:56,080
我要勒令你们关门14个工作日
I'm shutting you down for 14 business days.

899
00:39:56,080 --> 00:39:57,880
而你会收到一封罚款信
And you're getting a bill in the mail

900
00:39:57,880 --> 00:40:00,140
上面还会有非常让人不解的指示
with very confusing instructions.

901
00:40:00,720 --> 00:40:01,360
还有
And...

902
00:40:01,360 --> 00:40:03,660
我要在这里办我的生日会
I'm having my birthday here.

903
00:40:05,240 --> 00:40:07,233
咱们走 二链子
Let's bounce, 2 Chainz.

904
00:40:10,520 --> 00:40:11,660
再见啦 兄弟
So long, pal.

905
00:40:11,780 --> 00:40:14,220
你得找别人来当你的磨牙玩具了
You're gonna have to find someone else to use as a chew toy.

906
00:40:16,840 --> 00:40:17,720
好吧
Oh, man.

907
00:40:18,580 --> 00:40:20,580
酒吧的事真遗憾啊 姑娘们
Sorry about the bar, girls.

908
00:40:21,040 --> 00:40:23,620
看来我只能跟你外带瓶酒
I mean, guess I'm gonna have to get me a bottle of rose

909
00:40:23,940 --> 00:40:25,540
然后去费尔斯太太饼干店里喝了
and head over to Mrs. Fields' again.

910
00:40:27,380 --> 00:40:28,860
她有姐妹吗
Does she have a sister?

911
00:40:29,200 --> 00:40:30,340
或者是彩色电视呢
Or a color TV?

912
00:40:31,960 --> 00:40:32,920
再见啦 姑娘们
See you later, girls.

913
00:40:33,120 --> 00:40:35,200
看来我得跟这位老先生一起去派对啦
It look like I'm gonna go party with the old man right here.

914
00:40:40,580 --> 00:40:42,680
各位能再多等我们一会
Can you guys just give us another minute?

915
00:40:43,100 --> 00:40:44,860
或者14个工作日吗
Or 14 business days?

916
00:40:45,980 --> 00:40:48,460
唯一比我们还短命的大概只有
The only thing that opened and closed faster than us

917
00:40:48,460 --> 00:40:50,120
不卖座电影《威士忌 探戈 狐步舞》了
was Whiskey, Tango, Foxtrot.

918
00:40:51,160 --> 00:40:53,580
幸好我没特别花钱去弄头发
Well, at least I didn't get a blow out for this.

919
00:40:53,680 --> 00:40:55,560
让开幕失败所带来的伤痛轻了一点
That lessens the sting of a failed opening.

920
00:40:55,900 --> 00:40:56,520
开什么玩笑
Are you kidding?

921
00:40:56,900 --> 00:40:58,820
我觉得这会让我们更炙手可热
I think this is gonna make us more popular.

922
00:40:59,080 --> 00:41:01,120
人永远都会想要他们得不到的东西
You know how people always want what they can't have.

923
00:41:01,240 --> 00:41:02,320
就像你想要所有东西一样
Like you with everything.

924
00:41:03,480 --> 00:41:05,680
如果这是真的 你为什么看起来很难过
If that's true, then why do you look upset?

925
00:41:07,000 --> 00:41:08,860
因为我跟兰迪真的彻底分手了
'Cause Randy and I are really broken up.

926
00:41:09,400 --> 00:41:11,680
各种分分合合的明星夫妻条款
We burned through the Affleck-Garner clause,

927
00:41:12,020 --> 00:41:13,620
或者招数都被我们拿来用过了
the Cox-Arquette addendum.

928
00:41:14,220 --> 00:41:16,260
直到最终我们要用比伯跟戈麦斯原则时
As soon as we got to the Bieber-Gomez principle,

929
00:41:16,260 --> 00:41:17,780
我们都看不起自己了才结束
we were ashamed of ourselves.

930
00:41:19,360 --> 00:41:21,680
麦克斯 你可是破坏规矩界的女王
Max, you're the queen of not following the rules.

931
00:41:21,840 --> 00:41:23,080
你不是说"规矩 屁矩"吗
"Rules, schmules," You say.

932
00:41:23,160 --> 00:41:23,658
对啊
Yes!

933
00:41:23,658 --> 00:41:25,602
规矩 屁矩
Rules, schmules!

934
00:41:25,936 --> 00:41:28,455
还有保险套 屁险套
And condoms, schmondoms.

935
00:41:30,660 --> 00:41:32,100
这个就不怎么样
Yeah, that one's not great.

936
00:41:32,780 --> 00:41:34,840
我的意思是你总自己想出新东西
What I'm saying is you make stuff up.

937
00:41:34,840 --> 00:41:35,920
就像这个甜品酒吧
Like this dessert bar.

938
00:41:36,020 --> 00:41:37,380
而这是个很棒的点子
And that was a great idea.

939
00:41:37,420 --> 00:41:39,780
所以你也应该为你和兰迪定个新规矩
So you should make up rules for you and Randy.

940
00:41:40,540 --> 00:41:42,300
因为感觉你们真的很在乎彼此啊
'Cause it really seems like you guys care about each other.

941
00:41:42,980 --> 00:41:43,840
好吧 你说得对
Yeah, you're right.

942
00:41:44,960 --> 00:41:46,160
分手 分屁手
Break-up, schmake-up.

943
00:41:46,500 --> 00:41:47,580
去吧 打给兰迪
Now, go call Randy

944
00:41:47,580 --> 00:41:49,280
恶心到我想烧掉我的平板吧
and make me want to burn my iPad.

945
00:41:51,060 --> 00:41:52,800
去吧 求你了
Go, I'm begging you.

946
00:41:54,120 --> 00:41:55,860
我们绝对会大展宏图
Yeah, we're gonna kill it

947
00:41:55,860 --> 00:41:57,640
只要再等14个工作日就行了
in 14 business days.
